### Variables
@host = http://localhost:5248

### 1. Fast Health Check
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Built-in OpenAPI 3.2 Document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Orders for Customer 1 (Cached via HybridCache)
# 1st call queries DB, 2nd call returns immediately from HybridCache
GET {{host}}/api/customers/1/orders
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create Order (POST) - Valid Model
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "sku": "WIDGET-PRO-11",
  "quantity": 3,
  "unitPrice": 49.99
}

### 5. Update Order (PUT) - Reusing the EXACT SAME Validation Model
PUT {{host}}/api/orders/101
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "sku": "WIDGET-PRO-11",
  "quantity": 10,
  "unitPrice": 45.00
}

### 6. Validation Failure: Customer does not exist in DB (Async check)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 404,
  "sku": "WIDGET-PRO-11",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unitPrice": 25.00
}

### 7. Validation Failure: Discontinued SKU
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "sku": "DISCONTINUED-PART",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 10.00
}

### 8. Interactive Scalar UI Documentation
# Open in browser:
# http://localhost:5248/scalar/v1
